结论：这个代码库目前**没有真正接后端 API**，也**没有现成的业务后端接口层**。它现在是一个纯前端 demo，数据和流程都写死在前端里。

证据在这些文件里：
- [src/routes/index.tsx](/Users/lin/researcher-baobyte/frontend/nobli_lovable_v1/src/routes/index.tsx:26) 用本地 `useState` 管整个运行态，步骤推进靠定时器，不是后端返回。
- [src/lib/script.ts](/Users/lin/researcher-baobyte/frontend/nobli_lovable_v1/src/lib/script.ts:6) 整个 agent 流程是硬编码的 `SCRIPT`。
- [src/lib/mock-data.ts](/Users/lin/researcher-baobyte/frontend/nobli_lovable_v1/src/lib/mock-data.ts:15) 所有业务数据结构和 mock 内容都在这里。
- [src/components/AgentStream.tsx](/Users/lin/researcher-baobyte/frontend/nobli_lovable_v1/src/components/AgentStream.tsx:140) 根据 `output.kind` 渲染不同卡片，但卡片内部还是直接读 mock 数据。
- [src/server.ts](/Users/lin/researcher-baobyte/frontend/nobli_lovable_v1/src/server.ts:40) 只有 TanStack Start 的 SSR `fetch` 入口，不是业务 API。
- [src/router.tsx](/Users/lin/researcher-baobyte/frontend/nobli_lovable_v1/src/router.tsx:1) 虽然建了 `QueryClient`，但当前没有 `useQuery` / loader / server function 在用。

**现在前端已经“预留了业务模块”，但没有“开放好的后端 API”**。如果要接后端，建议不要按页面零碎地接，而是按“一个研究任务运行 run”来设计。

**前端现在实际需要的数据块**
- `task/run 基本信息`：任务文本、当前状态、当前阶段、耗时、模式。
- `steps`：时间线每一步的数据。这个是主干结构，UI 最依赖它。
- `tool detail`：每一步里 `tool` 的输入、输出、sources、citations、耗时、状态。
- `payload`：某一步对应的业务内容，按 `output.kind` 分类型。
- `paper`：右侧 Final Paper Viewer 的论文内容。
- `sidebar/meta`：历史任务、积分/credits、用户信息，这些现在也是写死的。

前端已经隐含出的核心 step 结构，基本就是这个：
```ts
type StepStatus = "running" | "done" | "waiting" | "review";

type ToolBlock = {
  name: string;
  input: Record<string, unknown>;
  output: string;
  sources: string[];
  citations: string[];
  timeMs: number;
  status: StepStatus;
};

type OutputKind =
  | "literature"
  | "opportunities"
  | "approval-opportunities"
  | "experiment"
  | "iteration"
  | "abstract"
  | "publish"
  | "conferences"
  | "memory";

type Step = {
  id: string;
  stageIndex: number;
  title: string;
  summary: string;
  duration: string;
  status: StepStatus;
  tool?: ToolBlock;
  output?: { kind: OutputKind };
  sources?: string[];
};
```

**如果接后端，我建议后端直接返回一整个 `run`**
```json
{
  "run": {
    "id": "run_001",
    "task": "I want to write a paper about explainable AI in computer vision...",
    "mode": "Full Automation",
    "status": "paused",
    "currentStage": 2,
    "elapsedSec": 124,
    "approvedOpportunityId": "o1"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "stageIndex": 1,
      "title": "Searching arXiv, Semantic Scholar, Papers with Code",
      "summary": "Retrieved 312 candidate papers, deduplicated to 184...",
      "duration": "28s",
      "status": "review",
      "sources": ["arXiv", "Semantic Scholar", "Papers with Code"],
      "tool": {
        "name": "Literature Scraper",
        "input": {
          "query": "explainable AI computer vision faithfulness",
          "years": "2022-2025"
        },
        "output": "184 papers, 4 clusters identified.",
        "sources": ["arXiv", "Semantic Scholar", "Papers with Code"],
        "citations": ["Koh et al. 2022", "Chen et al. 2023"],
        "timeMs": 28000,
        "status": "done"
      },
      "output": {
        "kind": "literature",
        "payload": {
          "papers": []
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "paper": {
    "title": "Faithful-CBM: ...",
    "authors": [{ "name": "BaoByte", "aff": 1 }],
    "affiliations": ["LMU Munich, Germany"],
    "abstract": "...",
    "keywords": ["interpretability", "concept bottleneck"],
    "sections": [
      { "heading": "1 Introduction", "body": "..." }
    ],
    "references": [
      { "id": 1, "text": "..." }
    ]
  }
