## 6. Spacing System

```css
:root {
  --space-1: 4px;
  --space-2: 8px;
  --space-3: 12px;
  --space-4: 16px;
  --space-5: 20px;
  --space-6: 24px;
  --space-8: 32px;
  --space-10: 40px;
  --space-12: 48px;
  --space-16: 64px;
  --space-20: 80px;
}
```

Spacing rules:

* Prefer generous spacing around primary actions and major content.
* Keep dense research content organized but not cramped.
* Avoid equal spacing that makes all modules feel equally important.
* Use spacing to communicate hierarchy.

